{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Evacuation, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"许多类型的紧急情况可能会导致你不得不进行疏散。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"在某些情况下，各位可能有一两天的时间准备，而其他情况可能需要立即疏散。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"无论在什么情况下，计划对于确保各位能快速安全地撤离至关重要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"了解各自所在社区可能发生的灾害类型，以及当地针对每种具体灾害的应急、疏散和避难计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"如果建议疏散，请计划好如何离开，以及将去往何处。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"向当地官员了解今年有哪些避难所的名额。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"冠状病毒可能改变了所在社区的计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"确定几个你在紧急情况下可以去的地方，如另一个城市的朋友家或汽车旅馆。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"选择不同方向的目的地，以便在紧急情况下可以有选择。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"大多数公共庇护所只允许服务性动物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"熟悉离开所在地区的备用路线和其他交通方式。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"始终遵循当地官员的指示，并记住疏散路线可能是步行，这取决于灾害的类型。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"制定家庭/家族计划，以便在失散的情况下保持联系；包含会面地点，并根据情况更新。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"集合准备好撤离用的物资。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"准备一个“行囊”，当步行或乘坐公共交通工具撤离时可以携带，如果你有车，则准备好长距离旅行的用品。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"如果有车的话：如果有可能进行疏散，请保持满箱汽油。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"始终保持半箱汽油，以防意外需要撤离。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"加油站在紧急情况下可能会关闭，在停电期间也无法抽油。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"计划每个家庭带一辆车，以减少拥挤和延误。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"如果你没有车，计划好在需要时如何离开。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"与家人、朋友或当地应急管理办公室一起决定，看看有哪些资源可以利用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"下载FEMA app，以获得在当地发生灾害时开放的避难所清单。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"收听电池供电的收音机，遵守当地的疏散指示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"带上应急用品包。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"提前离开，以免被恶劣天气所困。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"带上宠物，但要明白只有服务性动物才可以进入公共庇护所。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"现在就计划在紧急情况下如何照顾自己的宠物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"如果时间允许：依照家庭通讯计划中的州外联系人打电话或发电子邮件。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"告知他们你的去处。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"关闭并锁好门窗，保护你的家。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"拔掉收音机、电视和小家电等电器设备的插头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"除非有水淹的危险，否则不要把冰箱和冰柜的插头插上。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"如果你的家受到损害，并且要求你这样做，在离开之前关闭水、煤气和电。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"留下一张纸条，告诉他人你什么时候离开以及要去哪里。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"穿上结实的鞋子和能提供一些保护的衣服，如长裤、长袖衬衫和帽子。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-036","input":"向可能需要搭车的邻居查询。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-036","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"遵循建议的疏散路线。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-038","input":"不要走捷径，道路可能被封锁。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-039","input":"对道路上的危险保持警惕，如被冲毁的道路或桥梁以及被压断的电线。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-039","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-040","input":"不要开车进入洪水区。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-040","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"如果你因风暴而疏散，在旅行前向所在的地方和家乡的地方官员核实。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-042","input":"如果要返回受灾地区，在重大事件发生后，要为日常活动的中断做好准备，并记住在风暴废墟被清理之前返回家园是很危险的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-042","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"在离开之前和到达之后，让朋友和家人知道。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-044","input":"为设备充电，并考虑购买备用电池，以防继续停电。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-044","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-045","input":"加满油箱，并考虑下载一个燃料应用程序，以检查沿途的停电情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-045","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-046","input":"带上水和不易腐烂的食物等用品，以便乘车时使用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-046","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-047","input":"避开停电或公用事业线，它们可能带有致命的电压。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-047","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-048","input":"远离它们，并立即向电力或公用事业公司报告。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-048","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1/sentence-049","input":"只在室外使用发电机，并远离家，千万不要在家里或车库里运行发电机或将其连接到家庭电气系统。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/evacuation","source_case_id":"sentence-049","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-evacuation-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":49},"eligible_pending_review":49,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":49},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Evacuation; page last updated 2022-05-19; retrieved HTML SHA-256: a63278deb384e3a4412a4735bee94e8995ba6da3dd49173eed3fa45fcd8f442d","version":1}
